rs/DDD.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://people.math.wisc.edu/~jsmiller8/Papers/DDD.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 和公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(P\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}\">\\(\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" href=\"?note=7d3f8d3dfdb54f27\" title=\"43-df-effective-open\">43-df-effective-open</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiffTest}(P,U)\\iff\\exists Q\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists V\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(P=Q\\land U=V\\land\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(Q)\\land\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}(V)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mu(Q\\cap V_n)\\le2^{-n}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DiffTest}(P,U)\\iff\\exists Q\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists V\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(P=Q\\land U=V\\land\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(Q)\\land\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}(V)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mu(Q\\cap V_n)\\le2^{-n}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定同一个有效闭类 Q 用于所有分量；V 的一致有效开性给出统一枚举。候选输入取任意集合及集合序列，以同值 Borel 见证保证测度函数总在其定义域上使用。</p>\n<p>既有一手来源《Denjoy, Demuth, and Density》§2.2 Definition 2.1（PDF 页 8）已在本轮核对；本页保持该检验的数学条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi01class","status":"resolved","id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi01class]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-open","status":"resolved","id":"7d3f8d3dfdb54f27","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-open]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 和公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 $\\mu$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。$P\\subseteq2^\\omega$，$U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。$\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}$ 见 [[43-df-pi01class]]，$\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}$ 见 [[43-df-effective-open]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi01class","status":"resolved","id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref